4	 * Live refresh reuses the exact transforms the snapshot was built with.
5	 *
6	 * Hardening: every fetch is bounded (timeout + size cap + content-type sanity),
7	 * live refresh is atomic (all transforms run into a local object, validated,
8	 * then swapped in one assignment — a failed refresh leaves state untouched),
9	 * and views subscribe via onStateChange so nothing renders stale data.
